1
00:01:33,908 --> 00:01:39,030
<font color="#FFFFFF">Run, Kankuro</font>

2
00:02:04,062 --> 00:02:05,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn you!</font>

3
00:02:23,403 --> 00:02:27,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cease fire immediately!
We might hit Lord Kazekage.</font>

4
00:02:28,125 --> 00:02:29,324
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-Yes sir!</font>

5
00:02:29,723 --> 00:02:30,891
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cease fire!</font>

6
00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:32,818
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cease fire!</font>

7
00:02:33,118 --> 00:02:34,286
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cease fire!</font>

8
00:02:34,685 --> 00:02:35,914
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop the attack!</font>

9
00:02:42,134 --> 00:02:43,532
<font color="#FFFFFF">G-Gaara...</font>

10
00:02:43,931 --> 00:02:45,699
<font color="#FFFFFF">What in the world is he after...?</font>

11
00:02:52,618 --> 00:02:54,785
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is he going to leave the village?</font>

12
00:02:58,509 --> 00:03:01,744
<font color="#FFFFFF">My man Sasori must really
be tired of waiting for me by now.</font>

13
00:03:03,941 --> 00:03:06,098
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is he going to take him
away alive?</font>

14
00:03:07,496 --> 00:03:08,594
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won't let him get away!</font>

15
00:03:08,794 --> 00:03:09,862
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

16
00:03:11,230 --> 00:03:12,728
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be running off carelessly!</font>

17
00:03:12,758 --> 00:03:14,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait until we can get
a unit together!</font>

18
00:03:14,884 --> 00:03:17,021
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll lose him if
we just sit around!</font>

19
00:03:17,381 --> 00:03:18,549
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll catch up soon!</font>

20
00:03:18,579 --> 00:03:20,216
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't go after him too far
on your own!</font>

21
00:03:20,246 --> 00:03:21,974
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah...! I know!</font>

22
00:03:28,164 --> 00:03:31,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">That jerk was after Gaara
from the start?</font>

23
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:32,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kankuro!</font>

24
00:03:33,027 --> 00:03:34,724
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't let him get away,
no matter what!</font>

25
00:03:34,994 --> 00:03:35,892
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

26
00:03:39,048 --> 00:03:40,016
<font color="#FFFFFF">He landed...?</font>

27
00:03:41,284 --> 00:03:44,639
<font color="#FFFFFF">There should be a unit
securing that area there...</font>

28
00:03:46,077 --> 00:03:48,104
<font color="#FFFFFF">My mission is accomplished.</font>

29
00:03:50,031 --> 00:03:51,598
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're late...</font>

30
00:03:52,098 --> 00:03:54,195
<font color="#FFFFFF">I told you not to keep me waiting!</font>

31
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:59,457
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cut me some slack...
This guy was pretty strong.</font>

32
00:04:01,354 --> 00:04:04,878
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why I told you to make sure
you were prepared.</font>

33
00:04:05,378 --> 00:04:06,676
<font color="#FFFFFF">How about the preparations here?</font>

34
00:04:06,706 --> 00:04:07,874
<font color="#FFFFFF">Things are all ready here.</font>

35
00:04:08,243 --> 00:04:10,070
<font color="#FFFFFF">I had plenty of time, you see...</font>

36
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:13,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was fully prepared unlike you.</font>

37
00:04:14,793 --> 00:04:17,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then, let's get out of here.</font>

38
00:04:26,815 --> 00:04:29,671
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll never be back here again...</font>

39
00:04:41,692 --> 00:04:42,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold it!</font>

40
00:04:42,691 --> 00:04:43,619
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it...?</font>

41
00:04:45,616 --> 00:04:47,543
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's too quiet...</font>

42
00:04:49,381 --> 00:04:51,877
<font color="#FFFFFF">There was a unit securing
the village entrance.</font>

43
00:04:52,736 --> 00:04:56,170
<font color="#FFFFFF">There should be quite a commotion
if the enemy landed there...</font>

44
00:04:56,769 --> 00:04:58,996
<font color="#FFFFFF">And yet, I don't hear
a single thing!</font>

45
00:05:00,594 --> 00:05:04,318
<font color="#FFFFFF">And... I've been sending
several messages,</font>

46
00:05:04,358 --> 00:05:06,185
<font color="#FFFFFF">yet there hasn't been
a single response.</font>

47
00:05:06,954 --> 00:05:08,382
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the hell's going on here?</font>

48
00:05:13,105 --> 00:05:14,842
<font color="#FFFFFF">L-Lord Kankuro!</font>

49
00:05:15,371 --> 00:05:16,300
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it?</font>

50
00:05:29,679 --> 00:05:31,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What's this...?</font>

51
00:05:33,244 --> 00:05:34,572
<font color="#FFFFFF">What a mess...</font>

52
00:05:40,004 --> 00:05:41,531
<font color="#FFFFFF">They weren't attacked just now...</font>

53
00:05:42,130 --> 00:05:44,697
<font color="#FFFFFF">It might've been before Gaara
started to fight...</font>

54
00:05:45,026 --> 00:05:46,923
<font color="#FFFFFF">There were even elite Anbu Black Ops
members here...</font>

55
00:05:47,392 --> 00:05:50,388
<font color="#FFFFFF">They must have been attacked at once
by a rather large group?</font>

56
00:05:51,386 --> 00:05:52,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or perhaps...</font>

57
00:05:53,483 --> 00:05:54,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">Perhaps...?</font>

58
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:57,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. It's nothing...</font>

59
00:05:59,304 --> 00:06:01,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">I made a thorough investigation</font>

60
00:06:01,501 --> 00:06:03,568
<font color="#FFFFFF">when Gaara took
the Kazekage position...</font>

61
00:06:05,225 --> 00:06:08,960
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way could there be a traitor
among the Hidden Sand Shinobi!</font>

62
00:06:13,113 --> 00:06:14,811
<font color="#FFFFFF">From the looks of this,</font>

63
00:06:14,851 --> 00:06:18,675
<font color="#FFFFFF">the guys who took Gaara just
passed straight through here.</font>

64
00:06:19,074 --> 00:06:20,103
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hurry! We're going after them!</font>

65
00:06:20,143 --> 00:06:21,071
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!</font>

66
00:06:25,834 --> 00:06:27,092
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's someone still alive!</font>

67
00:06:29,658 --> 00:06:31,485
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop! Don't move him carelessly...</font>

68
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,018
<font color="#FFFFFF">A paper bomb?</font>

69
00:06:57,386 --> 00:07:00,781
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like they fell for your trap,
Sasori my man.</font>

70
00:07:02,338 --> 00:07:07,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">Of course. Traps are made
to be fallen into.</font>

71
00:07:07,870 --> 00:07:09,098
<font color="#FFFFFF">I get it.</font>

72
00:07:15,688 --> 00:07:19,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm home! I've come back, now!</font>

73
00:07:22,947 --> 00:07:25,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa! Just as I'd expect,</font>

74
00:07:25,104 --> 00:07:27,370
<font color="#FFFFFF">things get pretty dusty when
you leave it for years!</font>

75
00:08:01,788 --> 00:08:05,343
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke... I'm back...</font>

76
00:08:06,681 --> 00:08:08,907
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I'm here to get you back...</font>

77
00:08:29,606 --> 00:08:31,104
<font color="#FFFFFF">It... It can't be...!</font>

78
00:08:31,173 --> 00:08:32,571
<font color="#FFFFFF">This means the group</font>

79
00:08:32,601 --> 00:08:34,369
<font color="#FFFFFF">that went to get Lord Kazekage
back has been...</font>

80
00:08:35,167 --> 00:08:37,494
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me...
they got Kankuro, too...</font>

81
00:08:40,290 --> 00:08:42,287
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get back! It's going to collapse!</font>

82
00:08:44,323 --> 00:08:45,352
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's that?</font>

83
00:08:52,810 --> 00:08:54,708
<font color="#FFFFFF">K-Kankuro...</font>

84
00:08:56,365 --> 00:08:58,332
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was only able to save
two of them...</font>

85
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:01,497
<font color="#FFFFFF">These guys are hurt!</font>

86
00:09:01,527 --> 00:09:02,626
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get them some medical attention!</font>

87
00:09:02,656 --> 00:09:03,993
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you going to do?</font>

88
00:09:04,523 --> 00:09:06,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">Isn't it obvious?</font>

89
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:07,848
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to get Gaara back!</font>

90
00:09:08,916 --> 00:09:09,944
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro...!</font>

91
00:09:10,284 --> 00:09:12,141
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was strong enough
to beat Gaara!</font>

92
00:09:12,241 --> 00:09:14,607
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't stand a chance against him!</font>

93
00:09:15,276 --> 00:09:17,703
<font color="#FFFFFF">So are you saying we should
just forsake Gaara?</font>

94
00:09:17,872 --> 00:09:19,071
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's not what I'm saying!</font>

95
00:09:19,130 --> 00:09:20,728
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we can just find out
where their hideout is,</font>

96
00:09:20,768 --> 00:09:23,394
<font color="#FFFFFF">we can form a unit later
and attack!</font>

97
00:09:25,022 --> 00:09:26,559
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess I can't stop him, huh...?</font>

98
00:09:27,318 --> 00:09:29,814
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen up! Just follow them...</font>

99
00:09:30,114 --> 00:09:31,651
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't even think about
making a move!</font>

100
00:09:31,751 --> 00:09:33,479
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... If I can!</font>

101
00:09:36,804 --> 00:09:38,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">That Kankuro...!</font>

102
00:09:57,173 --> 00:09:58,670
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're mocking me...</font>

103
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is it Gaara's sand...?</font>

104
00:10:41,405 --> 00:10:43,472
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hang on... Gaara!</font>

105
00:10:49,493 --> 00:10:50,731
<font color="#FFFFFF">I leave this to you!</font>

106
00:10:51,031 --> 00:10:51,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!</font>

107
00:11:09,063 --> 00:11:12,598
<font color="#FFFFFF">Deploy a pursuit unit and
have them go after Kankuro immediately!</font>

108
00:11:12,798 --> 00:11:13,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

109
00:11:14,026 --> 00:11:17,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">And contact the Hidden Leaf immediately
regarding this situation!</font>

110
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:19,717
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell them it's an emergency! Got it?</font>

111
00:11:20,017 --> 00:11:20,985
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

112
00:11:22,143 --> 00:11:23,811
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have a bad feeling about this...</font>

113
00:11:23,841 --> 00:11:27,775
<font color="#FFFFFF">Something...
Something's about to happen...!</font>

114
00:12:04,020 --> 00:12:05,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm counting on you, Takamaru!</font>

115
00:12:13,735 --> 00:12:14,564
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go!</font>

116
00:12:23,949 --> 00:12:24,918
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage...</font>

117
00:12:26,286 --> 00:12:29,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll be fine. I'm sure he'll come back
right away...</font>

118
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,078
<font color="#FFFFFF">This way, huh?</font>

119
00:13:35,441 --> 00:13:36,679
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wonderful...</font>

120
00:13:37,178 --> 00:13:39,634
<font color="#FFFFFF">I couldn't help reading it
over twice...</font>

121
00:13:39,974 --> 00:13:41,432
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess I should get to bed...</font>

122
00:13:44,627 --> 00:13:46,694
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh...? It's already morning...?</font>

123
00:13:47,093 --> 00:13:48,721
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh-oh... Not good.</font>

124
00:13:48,761 --> 00:13:51,387
<font color="#FFFFFF">I still haven't made the unit list
for the new team.</font>

125
00:13:51,716 --> 00:13:53,383
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not good, not good at all...</font>

126
00:13:56,179 --> 00:13:58,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where did I put...
those documents again?</font>

127
00:14:18,575 --> 00:14:19,344
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right...!</font>

128
00:14:32,824 --> 00:14:35,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you doing up so early...?</font>

129
00:14:43,577 --> 00:14:45,774
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone's still sleeping,
you know.</font>

130
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,069
<font color="#FFFFFF">You...?</font>

131
00:14:51,765 --> 00:14:54,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't leave the village unattended
for too long...</font>

132
00:14:55,819 --> 00:14:57,416
<font color="#FFFFFF">My business here is finished,</font>

133
00:14:57,456 --> 00:14:59,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">so I just thought I'd head back
as soon as possible...</font>

134
00:15:00,352 --> 00:15:02,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">Without even eating breakfast?</font>

135
00:15:03,247 --> 00:15:05,873
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll just find a teahouse or something
along the way and eat there.</font>

136
00:15:05,903 --> 00:15:08,599
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you doing here?</font>

137
00:15:08,739 --> 00:15:14,031
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a pain, but I'm supposed
to be your guide.</font>

138
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:16,587
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have no choice seeing
as how it's a mission.</font>

139
00:15:18,224 --> 00:15:19,852
<font color="#FFFFFF">Must be quite a hassle...</font>

140
00:15:23,716 --> 00:15:24,814
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here is fine...</font>

141
00:15:25,573 --> 00:15:26,642
<font color="#FFFFFF">The next time we meet,</font>

142
00:15:26,672 --> 00:15:28,439
<font color="#FFFFFF">we will be at
the Chunin Exams, huh?</font>

143
00:15:28,868 --> 00:15:31,105
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... See you around...</font>

144
00:15:34,999 --> 00:15:37,455
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's about time you become
a Jonin.</font>

145
00:15:37,495 --> 00:15:39,153
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll happen before you know it</font>

146
00:15:39,193 --> 00:15:42,088
<font color="#FFFFFF">if you stop saying stuff's a pain
and just carry out your missions...</font>

147
00:15:50,635 --> 00:15:52,003
<font color="#FFFFFF">What a pain...</font>

148
00:16:12,442 --> 00:16:13,500
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

149
00:16:21,229 --> 00:16:22,457
<font color="#FFFFFF">At last!</font>

150
00:16:35,008 --> 00:16:36,366
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like this wind...</font>

151
00:16:59,301 --> 00:17:01,198
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it, Sasori my man?</font>

152
00:17:01,497 --> 00:17:05,362
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought...
someone would be following us.</font>

153
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:07,089
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold it!</font>

154
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,548
<font color="#FFFFFF">I found you...!</font>

155
00:17:16,774 --> 00:17:18,801
<font color="#FFFFFF">You will return Gaara to me!</font>

156
00:17:26,390 --> 00:17:29,026
<font color="#FFFFFF">Deidara... You go on ahead...</font>

157
00:17:35,775 --> 00:17:37,073
<font color="#FFFFFF">As I recall...</font>

158
00:17:37,113 --> 00:17:41,666
<font color="#FFFFFF">he was the one who took Gaara
using that strange bird...</font>

159
00:17:42,335 --> 00:17:46,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then this must be the guy
who set the trap in the village...</font>

160
00:17:54,447 --> 00:17:57,343
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll show you... my puppet show!</font>

161
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,078
<font color="#FFFFFF">Crow!</font>

162
00:18:02,275 --> 00:18:03,234
<font color="#FFFFFF">Black Ant!</font>

163
00:18:03,633 --> 00:18:04,502
<font color="#FFFFFF">Salamander!</font>

164
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:28,865
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll say it again...
You will give Gaara back to me!</font>

165
00:18:32,928 --> 00:18:34,656
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're late!</font>

166
00:18:34,885 --> 00:18:36,183
<font color="#FFFFFF">Finally, you're here...</font>

167
00:18:36,852 --> 00:18:39,049
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gee, sorry about that...</font>

168
00:18:39,478 --> 00:18:41,945
<font color="#FFFFFF">This time it took longer
than I thought</font>

169
00:18:41,975 --> 00:18:43,612
<font color="#FFFFFF">to write up the documents
for the new team.</font>

170
00:18:43,912 --> 00:18:49,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">Today's our new team's first mission!
Aren't you fired up?</font>

171
00:18:50,032 --> 00:18:53,058
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've always been like that,
Kakashi Sensei!</font>

172
00:18:53,258 --> 00:18:55,923
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, come on.
You're already annoying!</font>

173
00:18:55,953 --> 00:18:58,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">It can't be helped.</font>

174
00:18:58,150 --> 00:19:00,686
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei's always had
that look of disinterest!</font>

175
00:19:01,445 --> 00:19:04,441
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm starting to lose
my dignity here.</font>

176
00:19:13,367 --> 00:19:15,663
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I'm not mistaken,
that's one of the Hidden Sand's...</font>

177
00:19:23,611 --> 00:19:25,379
<font color="#FFFFFF">Puppet Master Jutsu, huh...?</font>

178
00:19:30,271 --> 00:19:32,039
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then I'm going on ahead!</font>

179
00:19:32,837 --> 00:19:33,896
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not going anywhere!</font>

180
00:19:48,643 --> 00:19:49,512
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wha—?</font>

181
00:19:50,341 --> 00:19:52,467
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like waiting for people,</font>

182
00:19:52,507 --> 00:19:54,834
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I don't like
making people wait...</font>

183
00:19:59,557 --> 00:20:01,424
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll finish this right away.</font>

184
00:21:37,847 --> 00:21:39,505
<font color="#FFFFFF">With his brother's life at stake,
it looks as though this is a match</font>

185
00:21:39,545 --> 00:21:41,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">that the Challenger Kankuro
cannot afford to lose?</font>

186
00:21:41,771 --> 00:21:43,469
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, he is one of the finest
Puppet Masters in the Hidden Sand.</font>

187
00:21:43,499 --> 00:21:45,635
<font color="#FFFFFF">Meanwhile, the Champion Sasori
has yet to show his skills,</font>

188
00:21:45,665 --> 00:21:46,864
<font color="#FFFFFF">making his presence even creepier!</font>

189
00:21:46,894 --> 00:21:49,929
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow, Kankuro made the first move
by bringing out his Crow!</font>

190
00:21:49,959 --> 00:21:51,087
<font color="#FFFFFF">And it just went down...</font>

191
00:21:51,127 --> 00:21:53,723
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, the challenger still has
an ace known as the Salamander...</font>

192
00:21:53,753 --> 00:21:56,679
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow, and just as we speak,
there's the Salamander!</font>

193
00:21:56,778 --> 00:21:59,644
<font color="#FFFFFF">What sort of trick will it display for us?</font>

194
00:22:00,243 --> 00:22:04,607
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"Team Kakashi, Deployed"</font>

